    "text": "Ure Drihten s\u00e6de oft swi\u00f0e digle bigspell; \u00fea on sumne s\u00e6l s\u00e6de he \u00feis bigspel his leorningcnihtum and\nEft \u00fea \u00f0a \u00fe\u00e6s wineardes w\u00e6stmas geneal\u00e6hton, \u00fea sende he his \u00feeowan to \u00f0am fores\u00e6dum tilium, \u00fe\u00e6t\n\u00dea gel\u00e6hton \u00fea tilian heora hlafordes \u00feeowan, and sumne beswungon, sumne eac ofslogon, sumne\nEft se hlaford sy\u00f0\u00f0an sende o\u00f0re \u00feeowan, micele ma him to, and \u00fea manfullan tilian dydon sona embe\nHe sende \u00fea \u00e6t nextan his sunu to, and cw\u00e6\u00f0, Hi wylla\u00f0 forwandian witodlice minne sunu.\n\u00dea tilian \u00fea gesawon \u00feone sunu, and cw\u00e6don, \u00fees ys se yrfenuma; uton hine ofslean, and his\nHi gel\u00e6hton \u00feone sunu \u00fea and gel\u00e6ddon of \u00feam winearde and hine ofslogon.\nHw\u00e6t secgce ge, hu de\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s wineardes hlaford embe \u00fea w\u00e6lhreowan tilian, \u00feonne he cym\u00f0 him to?\n\u00dea cw\u00e6don \u00fea Iudeiscan, \u00fea yfelan tilian he yfele forde\u00f0, and bet\u00e6c\u00f0 his wineard o\u00f0rum tilium sy\u00f0\u00f0an,\nSe H\u00e6lend him s\u00e6de \u00fea be \u00feam hyrnstane \u00feus: Ne r\u00e6dde ge on bocum be \u00feam hyrnstane, \u00feone \u00fea\n\u00deys ys \u00feurh God gedon, and hyt ys wundorlic on eowrum gesih\u00feum, and ic secge eow for\u00fei \u00fe\u00e6t Godes\nHw\u00e6t \u00fea bisceopealdras, \u00fea \u00fea hi \u00feis bigspel gehyrdon, and \u00fea sunderhalgan sona oncneowon \u00fe\u00e6t he\nWe habba\u00f0 anfealdlice ges\u00e6d eow nu \u00feis godspell, and we willa\u00f0 geopnian eow \u00fe\u00e6t andgyt nu, for \u00f0am\nSe hiredes ealdor witudlice \u00fee h\u00e6fde \u00feone wineard is se heofonlica God, \u00fee h\u00e6fde gelogod \u00fea\n\u00dea het God hi oft \u00feurh his halgan witegan wineardes naman, for \u00feam \u00f0e hi wyrcan sceoldon gode\nBe \u00feam winearde cw\u00e6\u00f0 se witega Isaias: Ic abad \u00fe\u00e6t min wineard b\u00e6re me w\u00e6stmas, and he \u00fea\nGodes wineard so\u00f0lice is Israhela hiwr\u00e6den, and ic abad heora \u00fe\u00e6t hi worhton dom, and efne hi\nRihtwisnysse ic abad, and hi worhton hream: \u00feis s\u00e6de se witega be \u00feam unges\u00e6ligum Iudeum.\n\u00deone wineard he behegode, \u00fe\u00e6t is Israhela folc, mid m\u00e6rlicum burgum, and mid engla hyrdr\u00e6dena.\nSe stypel \u00fee he getimbrode, \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t st\u00e6nene tempel \u00fee se snotera Salomon gesette on Hierusalem\nGod bet\u00e6hte \u00feone wineard \u00feam wisum bocerum and \u00feam Sunderhalgum \u00fee heoldon his \u00e6, \u00fe\u00e6t hi him\nManega \u00fe\u00e6r ge\u00feugon of \u00f0am mancynne Gode, \u00feeah \u00fee hi sume unges\u00e6lige w\u00e6ron, and Crist forsawon,\nHe cidde eac him, and on sumne s\u00e6l cw\u00e6\u00f0, Wa eow bocerum and eow Sunderhalgum, ge hiweras \u00fee\nGe teo\u00f0ia\u00f0 eowre wyrta, and witudlice forl\u00e6ta\u00f0 \u00fea maran beboda \u00fee eow bebyt seo \u00e6, rihtne dom and\n\u00deas \u00feing gedafenode so\u00f0lice to donne, and eac \u00fea o\u00f0re na to forl\u00e6tene.\nLytle \u00e6r we s\u00e6don \u00fe\u00e6t se hlaford ferde on fyrlene wr\u00e6csi\u00f0 sy\u00f0\u00f0an he \u00feone wineard bet\u00e6hte.\nNe f\u00e6r\u00f0 God swa\u00f0eah feorr ahwyder aweg, se \u00f0e on \u00e6lcere stowe hys andweardnysse cy\u00f0; ac he let\nSe hiredes ealdor sende, swa swa we s\u00e6don \u00e6r, his men to \u00f0am winearde, wolde hys w\u00e6stmas\nHe sende eft ma \u00feeowan to \u00f0am manfullan tilian, and hi swa him \u00feenedon swa swa \u00feam o\u00f0rum.\nHe sende \u00fea \u00e6t nextan hys agenne sunu to, for \u00f0am \u00f0e se \u00e6lmihtiga God swa mildheort w\u00e6s us \u00fe\u00e6t he\nHe cw\u00e6\u00f0 to \u00f0am Iudeiscum, Hw\u00e6t de\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s hiredes ealdor be \u00fe\u00e6s wineardes tilium?\nAnd hi ne wendon \u00fea gyt \u00fe\u00e6t hi hyt sylfe w\u00e6ron, and s\u00e6don him to andsware, \u00fea yfelan tilian he yfele\nRihtlice hi demdon heora agenne dom.\nSo\u00f0lice gyf hi wiston \u00fe\u00e6t hi hyt sylfe w\u00e6ron, noldon hi andwyrdan swa amberlice be \u00feam.\nWitodlice se hyrnstan \u00fee se H\u00e6lend fores\u00e6de, \u00fee hylt \u00fea twegen weallas, ys se H\u00e6lend sylf, \u00fee\nManega \u00e6tspurna\u00f0 mid mislicum synnum \u00e6t \u00feam hyrnstane, ac hi habba\u00f0 forgyfennysse, \u00fea \u00f0e mid\nO\u00feer is \u00fe\u00e6t man fealle uppon \u00feone stan, and o\u00f0er is \u00fe\u00e6t se stan uppon hyne fealle.\nSe fyl\u00fe uppon \u00feone stan, se \u00f0e synga\u00f0 on Crist, and se \u00f0e Criste wi\u00f0s\u00e6c\u00f0, se stan fyl\u00fe uppon hyne,\nHe cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fea \u00e6t nextan, swa swa we cw\u00e6don \u00e6r, \u00fe\u00e6t Godes rice by\u00f0 eow \u00e6tbroden, and by\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re\nHim is so\u00f0lice \u00e6tbroden seo boclice lar, and eall seo deopnyss \u00fee be Drihtne spryc\u00f0, and is geopenad\nHw\u00e6t \u00fea bisceopealdras, \u00fea \u00f0a hi \u00feis bigspel gehyrdon, and \u00fea Sundorhalgan sona oncneowon \u00fe\u00e6t he\n\u00deeah \u00fee hi heardheorte w\u00e6ron and hetole on mode, and noldon gelyfan on \u00feone lifigendan Crist, \u00feeah\nUre geleafa is mara \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6re m\u00e6nigu w\u00e6re, for \u00f0am \u00f0e we gelyfa\u00f0 on \u00f0\u00e6s lifigendan Godes Sunu,\nUton smeagan nu georne \u00fe\u00e6t we sume w\u00e6stmas godra weorca Gode agyfan, and mid urum geleafan",
